<v Ira Glass>Coming up, pretending to be a normal person can be the most difficult make-believe of all. That's in a minute from Chicago Public Radio when our program continues.
<v Ira Glass>接下来，假装成一个正常人可能是最困难的虚构。一分钟后，芝加哥公共广播节目继续。

